<title>USA: Weeks stake held by Annenberg group.</title>
<headline>Weeks stake held by Annenberg group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Pennsylvania investor Walter Annenberg said Wednesday it holds a 6.8 percent stake in Weeks Corp or 940,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 270,000 common shares on Nov 7 at a price of $28.125 per share.</p>
<p>The stake is held for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
